# A value jump through SDL's own loop: a's flip toggle clicked (308, 424 at 1440 x 900), once the
# view's first paint (2.6 s) is over; the plane springs to the flipped curve on the sweep spring
# for 702 ms (FV 05), and the app logs how many frames it drew while the plane moved ("motion: N
# frames ..."). On a display (the user's check, README) frames follow vsync, about 0.7 x the
# refresh rate; with no active display, or --pace 60, SDL's callback rate paces them at 60 Hz
# without vsync: about 43.
size 1440 900
density 2
wait 3000
click 308 424
wait 1500
